  "note": "[b]Houndmaster update — 2026-11-06[/b]\nHound's Rush: DMG -40% → -20%; level-1 ACC 90 → 85. Hound's Harry: DMG -80% → -85%; now usable from rank 1. Both attacks can be used from any rank, start at 85 ACC, and retain bleed 2/2/3/3/4 for 3 turns. Rush concentrates damage on one target; Harry spreads bleed. The Houndmaster gallery image has been updated.\n\n[b]驯犬师更新[/b]\n猎犬冲锋：伤害修正 -40% → -20%，1级命中 90 → 85。猎犬突袭：伤害修正 -80% → -85%，新增1号位使用。两招均可从任意位置发动，1级命中85，流血保持2/2/3/3/4，持续3回合。冲锋强化单体集中输出，突袭侧重群体流血；展示图片同步更新。",
